{"page":91,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:80","surah":4,"ayah":80,"ar_uthmani":"مَّن يُطِعِ ٱلرَّسُولَ فَقَدْ أَطَاعَ ٱللَّهَ ۖ وَمَن تَوَلَّىٰ فَمَآ أَرْسَلْنَـٰكَ عَلَيْهِمْ حَفِيظًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Whoever obeys the Messenger obeys God. If some pay no heed, We have not sent you to be their keeper.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَّن","en_gloss":"(He) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"4:80"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُطِعِ","en_gloss":"obeys","transliteration":"yuṭiʿi","verse_key":"4:80"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلرَّسُولَ","en_gloss":"the Messenger","transliteration":"l-rasūla","verse_key":"4:80"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَقَدْ","en_gloss":"then surely","transliteration":"faqad","verse_key":"4:80"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَطَاعَ","en_gloss":"he obeyed","transliteration":"aṭāʿa","verse_key":"4:80"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ ۖ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"4:80"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"4:80"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَوَلَّىٰ","en_gloss":"turns away ","transliteration":"tawallā","verse_key":"4:80"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَمَآ","en_gloss":"then not","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"4:80"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَـٰكَ","en_gloss":"We (have) sent you","transliteration":"arsalnāka","verse_key":"4:80"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"over them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"4:80"},{"pos":12,"ar":"حَفِيظًۭا","en_gloss":"(as) a guardian","transliteration":"ḥafīẓan","verse_key":"4:80"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٨٠","en_gloss":"(80)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:80"}]},{"verse_key":"4:81","surah":4,"ayah":81,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَقُولُونَ طَاعَةٌ فَإِذَا بَرَزُوا۟ مِنْ عِندِكَ بَيَّتَ طَآئِفَةٌ مِّنْهُمْ غَيْرَ ٱلَّذِى تَقُولُ ۖ وَٱللَّهُ يَكْتُبُ مَا يُبَيِّتُونَ ۖ فَأَعْرِضْ عَنْهُمْ وَتَوَكَّلْ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ ۚ وَكَفَىٰ بِٱللَّهِ وَكِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They say, ‘We obey you,’ but as soon as they leave your presence, some of them scheme by night to do other than what you said. God records what they scheme, so leave them alone, and put your trust in God: He is sufficient protector.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَقُولُونَ","en_gloss":"And they say","transliteration":"wayaqūlūna","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":2,"ar":"طَاعَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"(We pledge) obedience","transliteration":"ṭāʿatun","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"Then when","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بَرَزُوا۟","en_gloss":"they leave","transliteration":"barazū","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عِندِكَ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"ʿindika","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَيَّتَ","en_gloss":"plan by night","transliteration":"bayyata","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":8,"ar":"طَآئِفَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"a group","transliteration":"ṭāifatun","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"of them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":10,"ar":"غَيْرَ","en_gloss":"other than","transliteration":"ghayra","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"that which","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَقُولُ ۖ","en_gloss":"you say","transliteration":"taqūlu","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"But Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَكْتُبُ","en_gloss":"records","transliteration":"yaktubu","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يُبَيِّتُونَ ۖ","en_gloss":"they plan by night","transliteration":"yubayyitūna","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فَأَعْرِضْ","en_gloss":"So turn (away)","transliteration":"fa-aʿriḍ","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":18,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَتَوَكَّلْ","en_gloss":"and put (your) trust","transliteration":"watawakkal","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":20,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":22,"ar":"وَكَفَىٰ","en_gloss":"And sufficient","transliteration":"wakafā","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":23,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"is Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":24,"ar":"وَكِيلًا","en_gloss":"(as) a Trustee","transliteration":"wakīlan","verse_key":"4:81"},{"pos":25,"ar":"٨١","en_gloss":"(81)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:81"}]},{"verse_key":"4:82","surah":4,"ayah":82,"ar_uthmani":"أَفَلَا يَتَدَبَّرُونَ ٱلْقُرْءَانَ ۚ وَلَوْ كَانَ مِنْ عِندِ غَيْرِ ٱللَّهِ لَوَجَدُوا۟ فِيهِ ٱخْتِلَـٰفًا كَثِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Will they not think about this Quran? If it had been from anyone other than God, they would have found much inconsistency in it.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَفَلَا","en_gloss":"Then (do) not","transliteration":"afalā","verse_key":"4:82"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَتَدَبَّرُونَ","en_gloss":"they ponder","transliteration":"yatadabbarūna","verse_key":"4:82"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْقُرْءَانَ ۚ","en_gloss":"(on) the Quran","transliteration":"l-qur'āna","verse_key":"4:82"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"4:82"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"it had (been)","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"4:82"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"(of)","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"4:82"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عِندِ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿindi","verse_key":"4:82"},{"pos":8,"ar":"غَيْرِ","en_gloss":"other than","transliteration":"ghayri","verse_key":"4:82"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"4:82"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَوَجَدُوا۟","en_gloss":"surely they (would have) found","transliteration":"lawajadū","verse_key":"4:82"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"4:82"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱخْتِلَـٰفًۭا","en_gloss":"contradiction","transliteration":"ikh'tilāfan","verse_key":"4:82"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كَثِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"much","transliteration":"kathīran","verse_key":"4:82"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٨٢","en_gloss":"(82)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:82"}]},{"verse_key":"4:83","surah":4,"ayah":83,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا جَآءَهُمْ أَمْرٌ مِّنَ ٱلْأَمْنِ أَوِ ٱلْخَوْفِ أَذَاعُوا۟ بِهِۦ ۖ وَلَوْ رَدُّوهُ إِلَى ٱلرَّسُولِ وَإِلَىٰٓ أُو۟لِى ٱلْأَمْرِ مِنْهُمْ لَعَلِمَهُ ٱلَّذِينَ يَسْتَنۢبِطُونَهُۥ مِنْهُمْ ۗ وَلَوْلَا فَضْلُ ٱللَّهِ عَلَيْكُمْ وَرَحْمَتُهُۥ لَٱتَّبَعْتُمُ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنَ إِلَّا قَلِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Whenever news of any matter comes to them, whether concerning peace or war, they spread it about; if they referred it to the Messenger and those in authority among them, those seeking its meaning would have found it out from them. If it were not for God’s bounty and mercy towards you, you would almost all have followed Satan.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَآءَهُمْ","en_gloss":"comes to them","transliteration":"jāahum","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَمْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"a matter","transliteration":"amrun","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْأَمْنِ","en_gloss":"the security","transliteration":"l-amni","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَوِ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"awi","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْخَوْفِ","en_gloss":"[the] fear","transliteration":"l-khawfi","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَذَاعُوا۟","en_gloss":"they spread","transliteration":"adhāʿū","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"[with] it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":11,"ar":"رَدُّوهُ","en_gloss":"they (had) referred it","transliteration":"raddūhu","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلرَّسُولِ","en_gloss":"the Messenger","transliteration":"l-rasūli","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَإِلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"and to","transliteration":"wa-ilā","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أُو۟لِى","en_gloss":"those","transliteration":"ulī","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلْأَمْرِ","en_gloss":"(having) authority","transliteration":"l-amri","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مِنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"among them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":18,"ar":"لَعَلِمَهُ","en_gloss":"surely would have known it","transliteration":"laʿalimahu","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":20,"ar":"يَسْتَنۢبِطُونَهُۥ","en_gloss":"draw correct conclusion (from) it","transliteration":"yastanbiṭūnahu","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":21,"ar":"مِنْهُمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"among them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":22,"ar":"وَلَوْلَا","en_gloss":"And if not","transliteration":"walawlā","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":23,"ar":"فَضْلُ","en_gloss":"(had been the) bounty","transliteration":"faḍlu","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":24,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":25,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"on you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":26,"ar":"وَرَحْمَتُهُۥ","en_gloss":"and His Mercy","transliteration":"waraḥmatuhu","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":27,"ar":"لَٱتَّبَعْتُمُ","en_gloss":"surely you (would have) followed","transliteration":"la-ittabaʿtumu","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":28,"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"the Shaitaan","transliteration":"l-shayṭāna","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":29,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":30,"ar":"قَلِيلًۭا","en_gloss":"a few","transliteration":"qalīlan","verse_key":"4:83"},{"pos":31,"ar":"٨٣","en_gloss":"(83)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:83"}]},{"verse_key":"4:84","surah":4,"ayah":84,"ar_uthmani":"فَقَـٰتِلْ فِى سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ لَا تُكَلَّفُ إِلَّا نَفْسَكَ ۚ وَحَرِّضِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ ۖ عَسَى ٱللَّهُ أَن يَكُفَّ بَأْسَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ أَشَدُّ بَأْسًا وَأَشَدُّ تَنكِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So [Prophet] fight in God’s way. You are accountable only for yourself. Urge the believers on. God may well curb the power of the disbelievers, for He is stronger in might and more terrible in punishment.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَقَـٰتِلْ","en_gloss":"So fight","transliteration":"faqātil","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":3,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تُكَلَّفُ","en_gloss":"are you responsible","transliteration":"tukallafu","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نَفْسَكَ ۚ","en_gloss":"(for) yourself","transliteration":"nafsaka","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَحَرِّضِ","en_gloss":"And encourage","transliteration":"waḥarriḍi","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ ۖ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minīna","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَسَى","en_gloss":"perhaps","transliteration":"ʿasā","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"will","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَكُفَّ","en_gloss":"restrain","transliteration":"yakuffa","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بَأْسَ","en_gloss":"(the) might","transliteration":"basa","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":17,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":19,"ar":"أَشَدُّ","en_gloss":"(is) Stronger","transliteration":"ashaddu","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":20,"ar":"بَأْسًۭا","en_gloss":"(in) Might","transliteration":"basan","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":21,"ar":"وَأَشَدُّ","en_gloss":"and Stronger","transliteration":"wa-ashaddu","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":22,"ar":"تَنكِيلًۭا","en_gloss":"(in) punishment","transliteration":"tankīlan","verse_key":"4:84"},{"pos":23,"ar":"٨٤","en_gloss":"(84)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:84"}]},{"verse_key":"4:85","surah":4,"ayah":85,"ar_uthmani":"مَّن يَشْفَعْ شَفَـٰعَةً حَسَنَةً يَكُن لَّهُۥ نَصِيبٌ مِّنْهَا ۖ وَمَن يَشْفَعْ شَفَـٰعَةً سَيِّئَةً يَكُن لَّهُۥ كِفْلٌ مِّنْهَا ۗ وَكَانَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ مُّقِيتًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Whoever speaks for a good cause will share in its benefits and whoever speaks for a bad cause will share in its burden: God controls everything.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَّن","en_gloss":"Whoever","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"4:85"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَشْفَعْ","en_gloss":"intercedes ","transliteration":"yashfaʿ","verse_key":"4:85"},{"pos":3,"ar":"شَفَـٰعَةً","en_gloss":"an intercession","transliteration":"shafāʿatan","verse_key":"4:85"},{"pos":4,"ar":"حَسَنَةًۭ","en_gloss":"good","transliteration":"ḥasanatan","verse_key":"4:85"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَكُن","en_gloss":"will have","transliteration":"yakun","verse_key":"4:85"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"4:85"},{"pos":7,"ar":"نَصِيبٌۭ","en_gloss":"a share","transliteration":"naṣībun","verse_key":"4:85"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِّنْهَا ۖ","en_gloss":"of it","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"4:85"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"4:85"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَشْفَعْ","en_